ate principal amount of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_44a9c49e-8f69-4001-9bb7-cb06aed447d1" contextRef="C_4e7631eb-053f-4bb9-a579-e770602f5e2f" name="us-gaap:SecuredDebt" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">250,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> (the &#8220;2026 Term Loan&#8221;) and (ii) a $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_2cb0ad9d-d445-4f8f-adfd-728a1e44c0c2" contextRef="C_d07b4b2a-f34f-4f00-827e-71cf80be4a8d" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacity" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">750,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> senior secured revolving credit facility (the &#8220;2026 Revolving Facility&#8221;). As of the date of issuance of these condensed unaudited consolidated financial statements, the 2026 Revolving Facility remained undrawn.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
